# Web app conventions

This project uses **Next.js 16** with breaking changes from earlier versions. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` for current APIs before assuming patterns from training data.

## Structure

- App Router pages: `web/src/app/`
- Shared components: `web/src/components/`
- API client: `web/src/lib/api.ts` → FastAPI at `http://localhost:8000/api`
- Supabase clients: `web/src/lib/supabase/` (client, server, middleware, config)

## Supabase SSR

- Browser: `createBrowserClient` in `client.ts`
- Server Components / Route Handlers: `createServerClient` in `server.ts`
- Session refresh: `middleware.ts` + `lib/supabase/middleware.ts`
- Gate auth only when `isCloudMode` is true (env vars present)

## UI patterns

- Tailwind 4 via `globals.css` — no separate `tailwind.config.js`
- shadcn-style primitives in `components/ui/` (card, badge)
- Lucide icons for navigation
- Keep existing page behavior working in **local mode** (no Supabase required)

## API calls

Use `lib/api.ts` typed helpers — do not scatter raw fetch URLs. Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` only when API host differs from default.
